| `pnpm --filter @jewelry/api test` | Passed — 11 files, 144 tests |
| `pnpm typecheck` | Passed — 6/6 workspace packages |
| `pnpm lint` | Passed — 76 files checked |
| `pnpm --filter @jewelry/api build` | Passed |
| 边界扫描 | Passed — AppModule 未导入 DeviceModule/EventModule/PrismaModule；DeviceModule 未注册 DEVICE_PORT/DEVICE_AUTH_PORT；无 PrismaClient 实例化；无数据库/Redis/对象存储/AI/微信 SDK |

